## Anatomy

```svelte
<PageNav.Prev />
<PageNav.Input />
<PageNav.Next />
```

## Usage

`PageNav.Input` commits on Enter or blur, reverts on Escape and selects its content on focus. In single-page mode with several columns, Prev and Next move a whole spread. Page labels (roman numerals for front matter) come from `viewer.document.pageLabel(n)`.

